{"path":"force-app/main/default/lwc/rlyPromoteRules/rlyPromoteRules.html","left":null,"right":"<template>\n    <!-- Promote tab: the \"How promoting works\" side panel for one card (board HubPromoteRules, 2) -->\n    <template lwc:if={isPanel}>\n        <section class=\"rp-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"rp-panel-head\" onkeydown={handleKey}>\n            <div class=\"rp-pnh\">\n                <div class=\"rp-grow\">\n                    <p class=\"rp-k\">{routeText}</p>\n                    <h2 class=\"rp-h2\" id=\"rp-panel-head\" tabindex=\"-1\">How promoting works</h2>\n                </div>\n                <lightning-button-icon icon-name=\"utility:close\" variant=\"bare\" size=\"medium\" alternative-text=\"Close\" title=\"Close\" onclick={close}></lightning-button-icon>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rp-pnb\">\n                <ol class=\"rp-rmini\" aria-label=\"The route\">\n                    <template for:each={routeItems} for:item=\"it\">\n                        <li key={it.key} class={it.cls}>\n                            <template lwc:if={it.isHop}><span class=\"rp-rma-lab\">{it.label}</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></template>\n                            <template lwc:else><span>{it.label}</span></template>\n                        </li>\n                    </template>\n                </ol>\n                <p class=\"rp-big\"><strong>{bigLead}</strong>{bigTail}</p>\n                <p class=\"rp-exn\">Example: REL-00018 and REL-00019 both change <span class=\"rp-mono\">AccountService</span>.</p>\n                <ol class=\"rp-prl\">\n                    <li class=\"rp-pr\">\n                        <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span><strong>Hotfix first</strong></div>\n                        <p class=\"rp-k2\">Hotfixes are listed first and can be promoted alone.</p>\n                        <div class=\"rp-ba\">\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">You tick</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-on\"><span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>REL-00021</b></span><span class=\"rp-pill rp-pill-bad\">Hotfix</span></div>\n                            <span class=\"rp-barr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">{goesLabel}</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-go\"><b>REL-00021</b></span><span class=\"rp-k3\">{hotfixButton}</span></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"rp-pr\">\n                        <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-b\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><strong>Goes too</strong></div>\n                        <p class=\"rp-k2\">An older release that changed the same component goes too.</p>\n                        <div class=\"rp-ba\">\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">You tick</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-on\"><span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>REL-00019</b><i>AccountService</i></span></div>\n                            <span class=\"rp-barr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">{goesLabel}</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-go\"><b>REL-00019</b></span><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-car\"><span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-car\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>REL-00018</b><i>older · same component</i></span></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"rp-pr\">\n                        <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\">×</span><strong>Must add</strong></div>\n                        <p class=\"rp-k2\">A newer release that changed the same component must be added, or Promote stays grey.</p>\n                        <div class=\"rp-ba\">\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">You tick</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-on\"><span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>REL-00018</b><i>AccountService</i></span></div>\n                            <span class=\"rp-barr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">Blocked until</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-blk\"><b>REL-00019</b><i>newer · same component</i></span><span class=\"rp-chip\">+ Add REL-00019</span></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"rp-pr\">\n                        <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">–</span><strong>{staysTitle}</strong></div>\n                        <p class=\"rp-k2\">Releases you don't tick that share nothing stay for later.</p>\n                        <div class=\"rp-ba\">\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">You tick</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-on\"><span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b>REL-00019</b><i>AccountService</i></span></div>\n                            <span class=\"rp-barr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-bcol\"><p class=\"rp-bl\">{goesLabel}</p><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-go\"><b>REL-00019</b></span><span class=\"rp-mc rp-mc-stay\"><b>REL-00020</b><i>CaseListView · stays</i></span></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2 rp-pfoot\">Ticking creates <strong>one promotion</strong>{footTail}</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rp-pnf\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"rp-linkbtn\" onclick={openGuide}>Full guide ›</button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </template>\n\n    <!-- Guide › How a change moves: the four rules, each drawn with two releases on the same component -->\n    <template lwc:if={isRules}>\n        <div class=\"rp-tiles\">\n            <div class=\"rp-tile\">\n                <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span><strong>Hotfix first</strong></div>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>Hotfixes are listed first and can be promoted alone.</strong></p>\n                        <svg class=\"rp-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 142\" role=\"img\" aria-label={hotAria}>\n                        <text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">Order on the card: hotfixes first</text>\n                        <text x=\"294\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">next stop</text>\n                        <rect x=\"8\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F2F7FE\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></rect><path d=\"M20 46.5 l2.6 2.6 l4.6 -5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text x=\"37\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00021</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#FEDED8\"></rect><text x=\"37\" y=\"70.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#8E030F\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hotfix</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">Oct 30</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"64\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LoginController</text>\n                        <rect x=\"128\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#C9C9C9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"137\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#AEAEAE\"></rect><text x=\"157\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">REL-00018</text><text x=\"137\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 27</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"184\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <path d=\"M64 108V118H294V115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M294 108.5L290.5 115.5H297.5Z\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></path>\n                        <text x=\"64\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0176D3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓ Ticked alone</text>\n                        <text x=\"184\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{staysTitle}</text>\n                        <rect x=\"254\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EBF7E6\" stroke=\"#2E844A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"294\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{toName}</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">REL-00021</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">alone</text>\n                        </svg>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\">Tick only <strong>REL-00021</strong>: the button reads <strong>{hotfixButton}</strong>. Other work waiting in {fromName} isn't included. An older release that changed the same component still goes with it.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rp-tile\">\n                <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-b\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><strong>Goes too</strong></div>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>An older release that changed the same component goes too.</strong></p>\n                        <svg class=\"rp-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 142\" role=\"img\" aria-label={goesAria}>\n                        <text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">Deployed to {fromName}: older  →  newer</text>\n                        <text x=\"294\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">next stop</text>\n                        <rect x=\"8\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F7FBFF\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.5 2\"></rect><text x=\"37\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00018</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 27</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"64\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <rect x=\"128\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F2F7FE\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"137\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></rect><path d=\"M140 46.5 l2.6 2.6 l4.6 -5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text x=\"157\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00019</text><text x=\"137\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 28</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"184\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <path d=\"M64 108V118H294V115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></path><path d=\"M294 108.5L290.5 115.5H297.5Z\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M240 69H247\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M253.5 69L246.5 65.5V72.5Z\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></path>\n                        <text x=\"64\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0B5CAB\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Goes too</text>\n                        <text x=\"184\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0176D3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓ Ticked</text>\n                        <rect x=\"254\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EBF7E6\" stroke=\"#2E844A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"294\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{toName}</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">REL-00019</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">+ REL-00018</text>\n                        </svg>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>REL-00018</strong> and <strong>REL-00019</strong> both change <span class=\"rp-mono\">AccountService</span>. Tick REL-00019: {toName} gets {fromName}'s AccountService, which already has REL-00018's change, so <strong>REL-00018 goes too</strong> (dashed box, \"Goes with REL-00019\").</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rp-tile\">\n                <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-r\" aria-hidden=\"true\">×</span><strong>Must add</strong></div>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>A newer release that changed the same component must be added.</strong></p>\n                        <svg class=\"rp-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 142\" role=\"img\" aria-label={mustAria}>\n                        <text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">Deployed to {fromName}: older  →  newer</text>\n                        <text x=\"294\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">next stop</text>\n                        <rect x=\"8\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F2F7FE\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></rect><path d=\"M20 46.5 l2.6 2.6 l4.6 -5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text x=\"37\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00018</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 27</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"64\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <rect x=\"128\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#FEF1EE\" stroke=\"#BA0517\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"137\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#BA0517\"></rect><text x=\"157\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00019</text><text x=\"137\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 28</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"184\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <path d=\"M64 108V118H282\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BA0517\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n                        <path d=\"M285 113l9 10M294 113l-9 10\" stroke=\"#BA0517\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n                        <text x=\"64\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0176D3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓ Ticked</text>\n                        <text x=\"184\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#BA0517\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Must add</text>\n                        <rect x=\"254\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\" stroke=\"#AEAEAE\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></rect><text x=\"294\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{toName}</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Promote</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">stays grey</text>\n                        </svg>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\">Tick only <strong>REL-00018</strong>: {fromName}'s AccountService already has REL-00019's later change, so it can't go without it. The row turns red, <strong>+ Add REL-00019</strong> ticks it, and Promote stays grey until then.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rp-tile\">\n                <div class=\"rp-prh\"><span class=\"rp-ic rp-ic-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\">–</span><strong>{staysTitle}</strong></div>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>Releases you don't tick stay for later.</strong></p>\n                        <svg class=\"rp-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 142\" role=\"img\" aria-label={stayAria}>\n                        <text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">Deployed to {fromName}: older  →  newer</text>\n                        <text x=\"294\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">next stop</text>\n                        <rect x=\"8\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#F2F7FE\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></rect><path d=\"M20 46.5 l2.6 2.6 l4.6 -5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><text x=\"37\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\">REL-00019</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 28</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"64\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">AccountService</text>\n                        <rect x=\"128\" y=\"30\" width=\"112\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#C9C9C9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"137\" y=\"40\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#AEAEAE\"></rect><text x=\"157\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">REL-00020</text><text x=\"137\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\">{fromName} · Oct 29</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"80\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" rx=\"9.5\" fill=\"#F3F3F3\"></rect><text x=\"184\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CaseListView</text>\n                        <path d=\"M64 108V118H294V115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0176D3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M294 108.5L290.5 115.5H297.5Z\" fill=\"#0176D3\"></path>\n                        <text x=\"64\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0176D3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓ Ticked</text>\n                        <text x=\"184\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5C5C5C\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{staysTitle}</text>\n                        <rect x=\"254\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EBF7E6\" stroke=\"#2E844A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"294\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#181818\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{toName}</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">REL-00019</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#2E844A\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">only</text>\n                        </svg>\n                <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>REL-00020</strong> changes <span class=\"rp-mono\">CaseListView</span>, which nothing ticked touches. It shows <strong>{staysTitle}</strong> and waits on this card for a later promotion.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </template>\n\n    <!-- Guide › How a change moves: the Promote card as an annotated example, callouts 1 to 4 -->\n    <template lwc:if={isCard}>\n        <div class=\"rp-mockwrap\">\n            <div class=\"rp-mock\" role=\"img\" aria-label={cardAria}>\n                <div class=\"rp-mockh\"><strong>{routeText}</strong><span class=\"rp-lnk\">ⓘ How promoting works</span></div>\n                <div class=\"rp-mgrid\">\n                    <ul class=\"rp-mlist\">\n                        <li class=\"rp-mr rp-mr-hot\">\n                            <span class=\"rp-cb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-grow\">\n                                <span class=\"rp-rl\"><span class=\"rp-co\">1</span><span class=\"rp-pill rp-pill-bad\">Hotfix</span><b>REL-00021</b></span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rt\">Partner sign-in fails</span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rs\">{staysTitle}</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"rp-mr rp-mr-car\">\n                            <span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-car\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-grow\">\n                                <span class=\"rp-rl\"><span class=\"rp-co\">2</span><b>REL-00018</b></span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rt\">Account rating rules</span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rs rp-rs-go\">Goes with REL-00019 (AccountService)</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"rp-mr rp-mr-on\">\n                            <span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-grow\"><span class=\"rp-rl\"><b>REL-00019</b></span><span class=\"rp-rt\">Account rating uses region</span></div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"rp-mr rp-mr-on\">\n                            <span class=\"rp-cb rp-cb-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-grow\"><span class=\"rp-rl\"><b>REL-00020</b></span><span class=\"rp-rt\">Case list view for agents</span></div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"rp-mr rp-mr-blk\">\n                            <span class=\"rp-cb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                            <div class=\"rp-grow\">\n                                <span class=\"rp-rl\"><span class=\"rp-co\">3</span><b>REL-00022</b></span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rt\">Case list view adds owner</span>\n                                <span class=\"rp-rs rp-rs-bad\">Changed CaseListView after REL-00020</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <div class=\"rp-mside\">\n                        <p class=\"rp-mside-h\">{bundleTitle}</p>\n                        <p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>2 releases</strong> · 7 components</p>\n                        <p class=\"rp-note\"><strong>Also goes: REL-00018</strong> (older change to AccountService — {toName} gets {fromName}'s version, which includes it)</p>\n                        <p class=\"rp-warn\">REL-00022 changed CaseListView after REL-00020: add it, or wait and promote them together. <span class=\"rp-chip\">+ Add REL-00022</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"rp-mbar\"><span class=\"rp-co\">4</span><strong class=\"rp-grow\">2 releases selected · 1 test class</strong><span class=\"rp-btn\">{promoteButton}</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <ol class=\"rp-leg\">\n                <li><span class=\"rp-co\">1</span><div><strong>Hotfix first</strong><p class=\"rp-k2\"><strong>Hotfix</strong> pill, top of the list. Tick it alone for <strong>{hotfixButton}</strong>. Unticked, it shows <strong>{staysTitle}</strong>.</p></div></li>\n                <li><span class=\"rp-co\">2</span><div><strong>Goes too</strong><p class=\"rp-k2\">Dashed box and <strong>Goes with REL-00019 (AccountService)</strong>. The panel lists it under <strong>Also goes</strong>.</p></div></li>\n                <li><span class=\"rp-co\">3</span><div><strong>Must add</strong><p class=\"rp-k2\">Red row: <strong>Changed CaseListView after REL-00020</strong>. <strong>+ Add REL-00022</strong> ticks it.</p></div></li>\n                <li><span class=\"rp-co\">4</span><div><strong>Promote</strong><p class=\"rp-k2\">Grey while something must be added or the title is empty. Approvers and admins only.</p></div></li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n    </template>\n</template>"}
